# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository. Git for Windows has a
# system-level core.autocrlf=true, so a checkout on Windows would otherwise
# turn LF into CRLF and show every file as modified from WSL. Keep .bat/.cmd
# as CRLF because Windows shells expect it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
